    },
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Task 1: Page skeleton, scaling, cat movement and the static-content checks"
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "b2685164",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Depends on",
      "styles" : {
        "bold" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : ": None"
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "c8049760",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Cites",
      "styles" : {
        "bold" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : ": A1, A2, A10, A12"
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "0d3602dd",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Create "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "src/main/resources/cucumber-panic.html",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " (new, one file, inline CSS and JS): the full-window canvas with a fixed 800x600 logical size scaled by CSS to fit the window at its aspect ratio, pointer coordinates mapped back to logical ones, the "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "requestAnimationFrame",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " loop with a clamped delta, the phase machine (start, play, over) with the start screen and its prompt, and the cat drawn with canvas primitives. Add the cat's movement (arrows or A/D held, left or right half tap or drag) clamped to the field, and the "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "window.__game",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " test handle. Create the "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "CucumberPanicStaticTest",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " JUnit test, which reads the file and checks for external references, "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "data:",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " URIs, "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "<img>",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : ", "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "<audio>",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " and size. Create "
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "src/test/resources/cucumber-panic.test.mjs",
      "styles" : {
        "code" : true
      }
    }, {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : " as the node harness that loads the page's script with a stubbed canvas and DOM. It must not implement spawning, hits or sound; those belong to Tasks 2 and 3."
    } ]
  }, {
    "id" : "d2a7f57d",
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "content" : [ {
      "type" : "text",
      "text" : "Touches",
      "styles" : {
